- grid must be min 10x10 and max size of 50x50 (but can be a rectangle)
- models must be trained unindependantly from the grid size
- font is 14px in height

- QTable:	- 4 possible actions (UP, DOWN, LEFT, RIGHT), 3 in reality at each time
			- 4 states possibles (on green apple, on red apple, on regular case, on obstacle e.g. wall or body)

- Rewards:	- eat red apple: 	-10 pts
			- eat green apple:	+10 pts
			- eat nothing:		-0.1 pts
			- Game over:		-100 pts
			- Win:				+100 pts
